  - m_Id: 10999245267542023
    m_Localized: You are ready.\nPlease head to Lothern Ruins first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542024
    m_Localized: 'The objective of this expedition is to secure the Awakening Core.

      We''re
      counting on you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542025
    m_Localized: Please obtain the materials needed for research there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542016
    m_Localized: I was waiting. Everyone has arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542017
    m_Localized: The current situation in the Erosion area is worse than expected.\nPlease
      be very careful while exploring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542018
    m_Localized: I've put together a few fragments to help you out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542019
    m_Localized: If you use it well, you can take your skills to the next level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542020
    m_Localized: First, complete the necessary preparations for exploration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542021
    m_Localized: You are ready.\nPlease head to Lothern Ruins first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10999245267542022
    m_Localized: 'The objective of this expedition is to secure the Awakening Core.

      We''re
      counting on you.'
