      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510672
    m_Localized: Changes the rune's target Memory Mana consumption by the value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510673
    m_Localized: Rune Target Memory Armor Multiplier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510674
    m_Localized: The armor provided by the target Memory of the rune is applied as
      a numerical multiplier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510675
    m_Localized: Rune Target Memory Amplification Change
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510676
    m_Localized: Changes the Amplification granted by the target Memory of the rune
      by the value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510677
    m_Localized: Rune Target Memory Healing Changes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510678
    m_Localized: The target Memory of the rune changes the recovered HP by the value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510679
    m_Localized: Rune Target Memory Knockback Change
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510680
    m_Localized: Changes the knockback distance given by the rune's target Memory
      by the value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510681
    m_Localized: Rune Target Memory Range Expansion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510682
    m_Localized: Expands the target Memory range of the rune by one level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510725
