    m_Localized: Fountain of Rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510770
    m_Localized: Faint light flows from the fountain along with the quiet sound of
      water. It seems like the remaining power in the fountain can only be used once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510771
    m_Localized: Tombstone of Resonance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10185974310510772
    m_Localized: "\u201CThe letters engraved on the tombstone glow faintly in response
      to Memories. I think I can awaken the sleeping power of Memories.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
