  - m_Id: 11753938784624640
    m_Localized: Dustium condensed excessively, creating an Erosion zone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818944
    m_Localized: An unidentified mutant appeared in the eroded land,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818945
    m_Localized: It gradually became a dangerous place where it was difficult to
      enter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818946
    m_Localized: The society aims to identify the causes of Erosion and study the
      phenomenon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818947
    m_Localized: It was decided to investigate the Erosion area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818948
    m_Localized: After some time, a request to recruit exploration personnel was
      issued.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818949
    m_Localized: People with different reasons picked up the request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818950
    m_Localized: An exploration base was established at the border of the Erosion
      zone;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11753938788818951
    m_Localized: One by one they gathered there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
