  - m_Id: 11981180450119761
    m_Localized: Obtain 1 random artifact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119762
    m_Localized: 'dice decision

      Reward: HP recovery

      The higher it is,
      the higher the amount of HP recovery.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119763
    m_Localized: 'dice decision

      Reward: Increased Max HP

      The higher
      it is, the higher the Max HP increase.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119764
    m_Localized: "\u201CI hope this will be of some help. Please use it with caution.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119765
    m_Localized: "\u201CYour wounds have healed a little. I hope this strength will
      help you on your journey.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119766
    m_Localized: "\u201CMay blessings rest on your lives.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119767
    m_Localized: Obtain 35 Red Dustium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119768
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 9

      Success: Obtain 1 random artifact

      Failure:
      Party members'' current stamina reduced by 3'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119769
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 11

      Success: Mana regeneration increases by 1

      Failure:
      Party members'' current stamina reduced by 3'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119770
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 13

      Success: Obtain 1 epic artifact

      Failure:
      Party members'' current stamina reduced by 5'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180450119771
    m_Localized: The power remaining in the ritual tool seeps into the body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896896
    m_Localized: After digging through the traces, a Relic with strong power was
      revealed from inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896897
    m_Localized: The moment you touch the ritual tool, an ominous energy flows back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896898
    m_Localized: The moment the trace is damaged, the pent-up power explodes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896899
    m_Localized: I decided not to touch him any more and quietly left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896900
    m_Localized: I got an unexpected harvest. There doesn't seem to be anything more
      to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896901
    m_Localized: Caught in an unexpected explosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896902
    m_Localized: Roll 3 six-sided dice to obtain Red Dustium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896903
    m_Localized: There are still usable items visible among the corpses, but faint
      movement can be felt inside the pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896904
    m_Localized: Obtain 1 random Memory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896905
    m_Localized: 'Consumes 50 Red Dustium

      Obtain 1 random artifact'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896906
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 11

      Success: Obtain 1 random artifact

      Failure:
      HP reduced by 5'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896907
    m_Localized: 'Consumes 1 owned artifact

      Obtain 1 random artifact'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896908
    m_Localized: "\u201CGood. This was a good enough price.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896909
    m_Localized: "\u201CI was pretty lucky.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896910
    m_Localized: "\u201CIt wasn\u2019t a bad deal..\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896911
    m_Localized: "\u201CI will accept the shortfall with my life.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896912
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 8

      Accumulated Red Dustium 15'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896913
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 12

      Accumulated 45 Red Dustium'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896914
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 8

      Accumulated Red Dustium 15'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896915
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 12

      Accumulated 45 Red Dustium'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896916
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 8

      Accumulated Red Dustium 15'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896917
    m_Localized: 'Dice Roll 12

      Accumulated 45 Red Dustium'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896918
    m_Localized: Acquire accumulated red Dustium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896919
    m_Localized: I took the Dustium I had mined so far and left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896920
    m_Localized: Even the Dustium that had been mined was buried under the rubble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896921
    m_Localized: We succeeded in securing all the Dustium before it collapsed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896922
    m_Localized: Use the store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896923
    m_Localized: "\u201CI guess this is enough. I don\u2019t plan on holding on for
      long.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896924
    m_Localized: Increases Max HP of all party members by 12
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896925
    m_Localized: Increases maximum Mana of all party members by 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11981180466896926
    m_Localized: '90% chance of success

      Success: Awakening 1 Memory

      Failure:
      Memory loss'
    m_Metadata:
